We do a significant amount of business outside the U.S., including in developing countries.
A significant amount of our revenue is generated in developing countries and we intend to expand our business in certain developing
countries in which AES or its customers have an existing presence. International operations, particularly in developing countries, entail significant
risks and uncertainties, including:
• economic, social and political instability in any particular country or region;
• adverse changes in currency exchange rates;
• government restrictions on converting currencies or repatriating funds;
